      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**SHARP → GaussianViewer**\n\nNeeds the **ComfyUI-Sharp** nodes (registry: `comfyui-sharp`) for the splat.\n\n1. **Queue.** SHARP turns the photo into a splat and the viewer loads it (the previews stay empty: no camera yet).\n2. **Frame a view.** Drag to orbit, right-drag to pan, wheel to dolly, WASD / QE / RF / ZC to fly. The **i** button shows the buttons and the full key list.\n3. **Set Camera** (button or Enter), then **queue again**: the view, its hole mask and the camera pose come out on the right.\n\nSwap the photo in Load Image to try your own."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**GaussianViewer check**\n\n1. **Queue.** SHARP turns the photo into a splat and the viewer loads it (the previews stay empty: no camera yet).\n2. **Frame a view.** Drag to orbit, right-drag to pan, wheel to dolly, WASD / QE / RF / ZC to fly. The **i** button shows the buttons and the full key list.\n3. **Set Camera** (button or Enter), then **queue again**: the view, its hole mask and the camera pose come out on the right.\n\nSwap the photo in Load Image to try your own."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
